# Vegan Icelandic Rye Bread (Rúgbrauð)

## Ingredients
- 2 cups rye flour, 1 cup whole-wheat flour
- 1 tsp baking soda, ½ tsp salt, 2 cups oat milk, ¼ cup syrup

## Instructions
- Preheat the oven to 150°C (300°F) and grease a loaf pan.
- Mix the dry ingredients, then stir in the oat milk and syrup.
- Pour into the pan and bake for about 2 hours, until firm.
- Let it cool, slice, and enjoy — rye not give it a try?
